UID:she-got-game-emerging-talents-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261109T121647Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270901
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270902
SUMMARY:Deadline: Game Design Emerging Talents: She Got Game
DESCRIPTION:She Got Game is a Pro Helvetia mentoring programme promoting eq
 ual opportunities in the Swiss and international game industry\, supportin
 g the representation of women in management positions through dialogue wit
 h experienced international experts from the game industry.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Pro Helvetia (Swiss Arts Council)\nLocation: Remote/international mento
 ring programme\; applicants must be based in one of Pro Helvetia's liaison
 -office regions (Arab region\, East Asia\, South America\, South Asia and 
 Vietnam\, and West\, Central\, East and Southern Africa).\nAward: CHF 3\,0
 00 toward the production of a prototype or demo version\, plus individual 
 coaching and community access\; potential access to international trade fa
 irs. When attending trade fairs\, applicants with childcare responsibiliti
 es can request up to CHF 250 per week for childcare or children's travel e
 xpenses. No application fee.\nDuration: Six-month mentoring programme\, ap
 proximately 30 hours total commitment\; notification in November 2027\; ea
 rliest project start 1 January 2028. Next application window 1 July to 1 S
 eptember 2027.\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design
 -emerging-talents-she-got-game-3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&ut
 m_medium=referral
URL:https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/game-design-emerging-talents-she
 -got-game-3/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote/international mentoring programme\; applicants must be base
 d in one of Pro Helvetia's liaison-office regions (Arab region\, East Asia
 \, South America\, South Asia and Vietnam\, and West\, Central\, East and 
 Southern Africa).
END:VEVENT
